     "width": 40,
     "height": 56,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "look",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "The old captain's locker, just inside the ready room, with a private seal still on it. Nobody's opened it since the Fall, or nobody's admitted to it."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I go into the ready room and try the old captain's sealed locker."
      },
      {
       "name": "used",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "The seal holds. It's the old captain's, and nobody has the code, or nobody's admitting to it. Marrow could cut it. You'd have to decide to ask him."
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "l"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 4,
     "name": "The forward viewport",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 2,
     "x": 368,
     "y": 800,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 56,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "look",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "Stars, and the running lights of the ships nearest you. It's the coldest place on the ship, and everyone on the bridge has decided not to stand next to it."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I stand at the viewport for a minute and look at the fleet."
      },
      {
       "name": "used",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "You stand there a minute. The running lights of the nearest ships, and past them, nothing with a name. Nobody on the bridge comes to stand next to you, and after a minute you understand why."
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "v"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 5,
     "name": "Reddick",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 1,
     "x": 1040,
     "y": 928,
     "width": 48,
     "height": 96,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "person",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "reddick"
      },
      {
       "name": "asks",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "How long have we really got, Captain?\nIs there anything a hand can do?"
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "R"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 6,
     "name": "Pell",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 1,
     "x": 464,
     "y": 992,
     "width": 48,
     "height": 96,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "person",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "pell"
      },
      {
       "name": "asks",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "How's she handling, Ensign?\nWhen did you last sleep?"
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "P"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 7,
     "name": "The plot table",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 2,
     "x": 656,
     "y": 992,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 56,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "look",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "Forty-one green dots, and a few that flicker. Someone keeps wiping the glass where the Beacon's bearing would be, and it keeps leaving a mark."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I lean over the plot table and ask for a read on the formation."
      },
      {
       "name": "used",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "Forty-one green dots, and the one that flickers is the Slow Harriet, as it always is. The mark where the Beacon's bearing would be is back under the glass, where nobody's wiping it."
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "a"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 8,
     "name": "Start",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 4,
     "x": 816,
     "y": 992,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 64,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true
    },
    {
     "id": 9,
     "name": "Cracked repeater",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 2,
     "x": 848,
     "y": 992,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 56,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "look",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "A tactical repeater with a crack from corner to corner. It still works if you read around the split, and nobody has time to replace it."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I try to get a clean long-range picture out of the cracked repeater."
      },
      {
       "name": "used",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "You read round the split. Forty-one returns, and beyond them, where the Beacon's bearing would be, a smear the repeater can't resolve and won't let go of."
      },
      {
       "name": "facing",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "e"
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "r"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 10,
     "name": "The captain's chair",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 2,
     "x": 912,
     "y": 992,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 56,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "look",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "The seat's been patched with cargo webbing, and one armrest still has the last captain's thumb worn into it. It's yours now. Everyone on the bridge pretends not to watch you sit in it."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I sit down in the captain's chair and ask the bridge for a status."
      },
      {
       "name": "lookOther",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "The seat's been patched with cargo webbing, and one armrest still has the last captain's thumb worn into it. It isn't yours, and everyone on the bridge would notice if you got any closer."
      },
      {
       "name": "useOther",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I take a closer look at the captain's chair, while nobody's watching."
      },
      {
       "name": "used",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "You sit. The chair takes your weight the way it took his, and the bridge gives you a status without being asked: reactor at two-thirds, forty-one ships answering, and the signal still on every band."
      },
      {
       "name": "usedOther",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "You get as far as the armrest before Commander Voss looks up. You find you've stepped back."
      },
      {
       "name": "facing",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "w"
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "c"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 11,
     "name": "Lund",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 1,
     "x": 1072,
     "y": 992,
     "width": 48,
     "height": 96,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "person",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "lund"
      },
      {
       "name": "asks",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "What does the council want, Captain?\nMay I tell you something I've seen?"
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "U"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 12,
     "name": "Voss",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 1,
     "x": 912,
     "y": 1056,
     "width": 48,
     "height": 96,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "person",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "voss"
      },
      {
       "name": "asks",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "What's our real situation, Commander?\nIs there anything I should be worried about?"
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "V"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 13,
     "name": "Hot-bunk slate",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 2,
     "x": 1904,
     "y": 1056,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 56,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "look",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "Bunk hours, traded and re-traded in a dozen hands. Nine hundred people on a ship built for three hundred, and a hot bunk is worth more than money."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I read the hot-bunk slate and ask who's going without."
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "s"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 14,
     "name": "Roe",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 1,
     "x": 2992,
     "y": 1056,
     "width": 48,
     "height": 96,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "person",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "bastian"
      },
      {
       "name": "asks",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "How are people holding up, Father?\nWho are you here for today?"
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "A"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 15,
     "name": "Marchetti",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 1,
     "x": 1040,
     "y": 1120,
     "width": 48,
     "height": 96,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "person",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "marchetti"
      },
      {
       "name": "asks",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "Where are we going next, Captain?\nHow are the guns holding up?"
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "M"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 16,
     "name": "The chalked names",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 2,
     "x": 2448,
     "y": 1120,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 56,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "look",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "Names in chalk from the deck to the overhead, in dozens of different hands. Nobody ordered it, and nobody dares wash it."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I stop at the Names Bulkhead and read the names, taking my time."
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "n"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 17,
     "name": "Stub of chalk",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 2,
     "x": 2896,
     "y": 1120,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 56,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "look",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "A stub of chalk on a pipe bracket, worn down to a thumbnail. Someone will need it tomorrow."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I take the chalk and add a name I've been carrying."
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "w"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 18,
     "name": "Old Concord medal",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 2,
     "x": 3152,
     "y": 1120,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 56,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "item",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "old_concord_medal"
      },
      {
       "name": "look",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "A Concord service medal, hung from a pipe under one of the names. Its ribbon has gone grey."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I take down the old Concord medal and ask who it belongs to."
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "m"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 19,
     "name": "Vey",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 1,
     "x": 720,
     "y": 1632,
     "width": 48,
     "height": 96,
     "rotation": 0,
